Porting from GIF Lab

If you carry code from GIF Lab into another project, whether a person or a
model does the carrying, keep each file's copyright line and credit GIF Lab
in your own NOTICE file. If GIF Lab code is already in your project without
that credit, add it now, and name what you carried (a file, a feature or a
fix) so the next reader can find where it came from. A line like this is
enough:

    Includes code from GIF Lab (https://github.com/match-stik/the-gif-lab),
